275
00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:50.500
Ia agak sukar untuk dijelaskan.

276
00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.540
Cuba saya. Saya sedang mendengar.

277
00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.910
Di mana saya harus bermula?

278
00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.940
